{"id":"bootleg-mixtape","title":"Bootleg Mixtape","url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Bootleg_Mixtape","rev":233723,"fetched":"2026-10-16","lead":[{"t":"p","c":["The ",{"t":"b","c":["Bootleg Mixtape"]}," aesthetic is a graphic design style that dominated Southern Hip-Hop/Trap mixtape covers from the mid-2000s to the late-2010s. Pioneered by designers such as KidEight, Miami Kaos, Skrilla Design, and TanstA, the style is characterized by its use of cartoonish, hyper-real and thematic maximalism, featuring layered photo collages similar to its predecessor aesthetic, ",{"t":"a","c":["Pen & Pixel"],"id":"pen-pixel"},"."]}],"sections":[{"title":"Visuals","id":"visuals","blocks":[{"t":"p","c":["Much like its predecessor aesthetic, Bootleg Mixtape uses heavy lens flares, airbrushing effects, digital collaging, and photo editing to create hyper-real and thematic scenes. A central feature from this style is its surreal and absurd parodies of pop-culture media."]}]},{"title":"Gallery","id":"gallery","blocks":[{"t":"gallery","items":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/2/2a/2102af32064e692bb7a3c8cf60da0585.640x640x1.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230809040207","w":160,"h":160,"cap":["Yo Gotti \"Cocaine Muzik 3\""]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/7/7f/Toasttothescumbags.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260812174721","w":160,"h":160,"cap":["Kanye West \"Toast To The Scumbags\""]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/3/35/Gucci_mane_-_trap_story.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260812153548","w":160,"h":160,"cap":["Gucci Mane/Various Artists \"Trap Story\""]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/2/27/Gucci-mane-gotta-have-the-best-album-covers-of-all-time-ong-v0-4em0qkavjio91.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260812174941","w":160,"h":160,"cap":["DJ Fletch & Gucci Mane \"Gucci Gone Bonkers\""]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/c/cd/4f25f924-c6ff-420d-9998-fb036082f02b.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20260812175327","w":160,"h":160,"cap":["DJ Spinatik \"Street Runnaz 46\""]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/7/7d/Ab67616d0000b2732410fdbc6fa83f48cefff791.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20260812175329","w":160,"h":160,"cap":["Yo Gotti \"5 Star Chef\""]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/1/1c/31f40a21f16c26090d3eb69d01dca568.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260812175328","w":160,"h":160,"cap":["DJ Drama & Gucci Mane \"The Burrprint (The Movie 3D)\""]},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/e/e7/Plugway_2.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260812175619","w":160,"h":160,"cap":["DJ Ben Frank \"Plugway 2: Trap Fresh\""]}]}]}]}